[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `<%`/`%>` = `{`/`}`) and `<iso646.h>` macros (`bitor` = `|`, `compl` = `~`).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m That is cosmetic; it does not change semantics.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
